  "title": "Frontier Nuclear’s Portfolio Company, Kadmos Energy, Launches Dual Experimental Validation Program for Its SMR Design",
  "summary": "Winnipeg, Manitoba–(Newsfile Corp. – April 29, 2026) – Frontier Nuclear and Minerals Inc. (NASDAQ: FNUC), d/b/a Frontier Nuclear (“Frontier“), a nuclear fuel cycle company, announces that its portfolio company, Kadmos Energy Services LLC (“Kadmos“), has initiated a two-stream experimental validation program, which will establish the empirical foundation for Kadmos’ small modular reactor (“SMR“) design and its […]",
